GPL-2.0 is not an arbitrary choice: tier4/applet-mitm is a libstratosphere
sysmodule. It is compiled inside an Atmosphère checkout, links libstratosphere,
and ships a patch against it (tier4/applet-mitm/patch_libstrat.py). Atmosphère
is GPL-2.0, so anything built this way is too.


