Derived work
------------

tier4/applet-mitm/source/vic40_config.hpp transcribes the VIC 4.0 register
methods and configuration-struct layout from libdrm's Tegra backend
(vic.h / vic40.h, Copyright (c) 2018 NVIDIA Corporation, MIT). Every one of the
nine config structs in it was diffed field-for-field and bit-for-bit against
those headers.

tier4/applet-mitm/source/applet_mitm_uvc.cpp (v0.4 webcam mode) follows
Insektaure's SysDVR-UVC-Capture (GPL-2.0, source/uvc/uvc_device.c and
docs/RESEARCH.md): the UVC descriptor layout, the EP0 control-transfer handling
on usb:ds (manual status stages, StallCtrl), probe/commit negotiation and the
bulk payload rules (2-byte headers, FID toggling, zero-length packets,
cancel-and-reap on timeout). Adapted to two frame sizes at 60 fps and a sender
fed by this project's NVENC stream.

tier4/applet-mitm/source/nvjpg_dec_control.h, generated by
tools/nvjpg_dec_control.py, is a test job for the NVJPG engine. Its decode
picture-info record is laid out at the field offsets of the T210 hardware's
record as averne's oss-nvjpg documents it (GPL-3.0,
include/nvjpg/nv/registers.hpp): the offsets describe the hardware; no code
from oss-nvjpg is in this tree. It runs only in a test install armed with
"jpgdec".

tier4/applet-mitm/patch_libstrat.py backports Atmosphère commit b05166d50
(GPL-2.0): mitm ForwardRequest closes the request's copy handles.

tier4/applet-mitm/source/applet_mitm_nv.cpp (FindLibnxNvMaps) and
applet_mitm_audout.cpp rely on libnx's data layouts (ISC): struct NvMap
(nvidia/map.h) and AudioOutBuffer plus the audout:u commands
(services/audout.h). Only the layouts are used; no libnx code is copied.
